Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["TerminalDiversityMutation", "ObjectName",
 CellID->380206515,ExpressionUUID->"2a2b2058-983b-4345-8b49-047e70af5a3a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"18c752df-018c-8e44-97b0-2eb2f0981136"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   ButtonBox["TerminalDiversityMutation",
    BaseStyle->"Link",
    ButtonData->
     "paclet:SamuelFrerichs/StructureAdaptiveEvolution/ref/\
TerminalDiversityMutation"], 
   RowBox[{"[", "rule", "]"}]}]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "a43a7f89-8d32-d14c-ac93-eb418b99ec5f"],
 " \[LineSeparator]",
 "proposes a terminal-diversity mutation of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["rule", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "50f299da-6b09-924c-8c0a-b87c44498e20"],
 "."
}], "Usage",
 CellID->494722435,ExpressionUUID->"25f72bb4-6f00-2740-a0c3-91e9e8e25a4c"],

Cell["\<\
This is catalog strategy 5, \"TerminalDiversity\", of the approved \
15-strategy mutation catalog.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->308629743,ExpressionUUID->"40ae153c-0a39-3f4d-b9ef-49d3c9e78f76"],

Cell["\<\
Operators: SplitVariable, AddMotif (attach an asymmetric pendant, pendant \
path or loop) and, in the ordered and declared universes, PermuteEdgeOrder \
(permute the slots of one edge).\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->547263660,ExpressionUUID->"ee6e68d3-cb88-bb47-afb2-ece7e62c620b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The strategy is opt-in: select it with \"MutationStrategies\" -> \
{\"TerminalDiversity\"} in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
   "StructureAdaptiveEvolution", 
    "paclet:SamuelFrerichs/StructureAdaptiveEvolution/ref/\
StructureAdaptiveEvolution", 
    "https://reference.wolfram.com/language/SamuelFrerichs/\
StructureAdaptiveEvolution/ref/StructureAdaptiveEvolution.html"},
   "TextRefLink",
   DisplayFunction->(TagBox[
     ButtonBox[
      StyleBox[#, ShowStringCharacters -> True, FontFamily -> 
       "Source Sans Pro"], 
      BaseStyle -> {"Link", FontColor -> LightDarkSwitched[
          RGBColor[0.02, 0.286, 0.651], 
          RGBColor[0.2823, 0.6666, 0.949]]}, ButtonData -> #2, ContentPadding -> 
      False], 
     MouseAppearanceTag["LinkHand"]]& )]],ExpressionUUID->
  "628b9594-ff59-eb4e-b77a-fca9965858e8"],
 ", or with \"Goal\" -> \"TerminalDiversity\", whose preset also promotes the \
catalog's primary objectives for the strategy to Pareto objectives."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->418965046,ExpressionUUID->"943f07cd-d3ce-8242-af53-834d6ba7f793"],

Cell["\<\
Mutations are random. The result is a canonically new rule (or rule set), an \
Association with \"Rule\" and \"Details\", or a Failure when no valid new \
proposal exists. Inside a search, every operator that ran is recorded in the \
candidate's provenance.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->172558969,ExpressionUUID->"a49f0d33-e0a7-2440-a537-9ed849aac02f"]
}, Open  ]],

